'
' 🧱 File: usecase_with_flags.puml
' ------------------------------
' 📌 Purpose   : Use Case — Slice 1 Report Error & Notify User (with FeatureFlagsManager)
' 🧱 Layer     : Documentation (PlantUML)
' 👤 Author    : Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Created   : 2025-09-04
'
' 🧠 Description:
' Use case diagram showing how QML user flow reports an error, checks the feature flag,
' writes a log when enabled, always notifies via Toast, and may show a fallback on failure.
'

@startuml
!define USE_CUSTOM_THEME
!include ../../config/style.puml
title Use Case — Slice 1 Report Error & Notify User (with Feature Flags)

' ==== Actors / Systems (FA6 Macros) ====
FA6_USER(user, "User", rectangle, #00EB09)
FA6_DESKTOP(qml, "QML View", rectangle, #2AA1D1)
FA6_TRIANGLE_EXCLAMATION(reporter, "ErrorReporter", rectangle, #03A9F4)
FA6_SLIDERS(flags, "FeatureFlagsManager", rectangle, #607D8B)
FA6_FILE(logmgr, "LogManager", rectangle, #FF9800)
FA6_BELL(toast, "Toast.qml", rectangle, #E5C55F)
FA6_CIRCLE_EXCLAMATION(fallback, "SmartFallback.qml", rectangle, #E5C55F)

' ==== Use Cases ====
rectangle "Report Error & Notify User" {
  usecase UC_Report as "Report Error"
  usecase UC_Check  as "Check features.logging"
  usecase UC_Log    as "Write Log"
  usecase UC_Toast  as "Notify via Toast"
  usecase UC_Fb     as "Show Fallback"
}

' ==== Relationships ====
user --> UC_Report
qml  --> UC_Report

' Reporter orchestrates
reporter --> UC_Report

' Includes (always executed)
UC_Report --> UC_Check : <<include>>
UC_Report --> UC_Toast : <<include>>

' Conditional / exceptional flows
UC_Report ..> UC_Log : <<extend>> [flag enabled]
UC_Report ..> UC_Fb  : <<extend>> [on failure]

' System responsibilities
flags  --> UC_Check
logmgr --> UC_Log
toast  --> UC_Toast
fallback --> UC_Fb
@enduml
